{"seq":15,"slug":"ai-friendly-documentation","title":"AI 友好的文档","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-友好的文档\">AI 友好的文档</h1><p>文档是系统知识的「人机共享层」。代码只说得出系统<strong>现在是什么样</strong>，说不出的那些——为什么这么设计、哪里是刻意保留的坑、新人怎么跑起来、当时放弃了哪些方案——历来靠文档承载。agent 时代没有削弱这个角色，反而把它推到了关键位置：coding agent 已成为仓库事实上的高频读者（AGENTS.md 格式被超过 6 万个开源项目采用、llms.txt 索引被 Chrome Lighthouse 纳入审计项），而且它读得比人更字面、更频繁、更不设防。同一份文档的价值方差因此被急剧放大：写得清晰、贴近代码、保持新鲜的文档，会被 agent 精确兑现成正确的改动；过期误导的文档，也会被精确兑现成错误的提交。</p>\n<p>本 hub 把这件事工程化：如何让文档既帮人也帮 agent，并且长期可信。全篇四章是一条递进的线：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>文档在 agent 时代的角色</strong>（第 1 章）——谁在读文档、agent 能用的文档长什么样（准确/结构/可发现/贴场景四条件）、文档与上下文文件这两类载体怎么分工；</li>\n<li><strong>真正有用的几类文档</strong>（第 2 章）——README 作为入口、ADR 与决策记录、内联文档与注释，各自承载什么知识、怎么写才不写坏；</li>\n<li><strong>写给人也写给 agent</strong>（第 3 章）——清晰有结构可发现的共同基本功、让文档贴近代码的分层策略、例子与可运行文档如何把「是否过期」变成一次构建就能回答的问题;</li>\n<li><strong>让文档保持真实</strong>（第 4 章）——文档腐烂为何对 agent 是负价值、同步如何织进流程与 CI、以及怎样把 agent 从文档的消费者变成维护者。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的边界\">与兄弟 hub 的边界</h2><p>本 hub 只管<strong>项目内部知识文档</strong>这一种载体；它与同 category 兄弟 hub 的分工如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../project-context-files/\">项目上下文文件</a></td>\n<td>AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md 这类<strong>常驻指令层</strong>该写什么、怎么精炼、怎么分层维护</td>\n<td>本 hub 管的是<strong>按需取用的文档层</strong>（README/ADR/参考/教程）；两层如何用指针互连在本 hub 第 1 章讲，常驻层内部怎么写归它管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../context-engineering-for-codebases/\">代码库上下文工程</a></td>\n<td>上下文工程的<strong>总纲</strong>——设计、组织、投放、维护 agent 在代码库里的全部上下文</td>\n<td>本 hub 是它在「沉淀的系统知识」这一个面上的展开：只管文档这种载体，不管检索索引、记忆等其他上下文形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../spec-driven-development-with-ai/\">规格驱动开发与 AI</a></td>\n<td><strong>任务级意图</strong>的真理源——一次开发任务的规格怎么写、怎么验证</td>\n<td>规格是短命的任务输入，本 hub 沉淀的是跨任务、随时间存在的<strong>系统级知识</strong>（决策、架构、用法）；两者衔接处是 ADR 与 constitution 式原则文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../agent-ready-apis-and-tools/\">面向 Agent 的 API 与工具设计</a></td>\n<td>对外暴露面——把自己的 API/工具做成 agent 可发现、可调用的自描述契约</td>\n<td>本 hub 管项目内部知识文档的写作与保鲜，不涉及对外接口的 schema、工具描述协议与错误语义设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../agent-tooling-in-the-project/\">项目里的 Agent 工具</a></td>\n<td>agent 的「手」——命令、脚本、MCP、skill 这些可执行能力怎么配置</td>\n<td>本 hub 管的是 agent 的「读」——文档是输入流而非工具；唯一交叉点是文档升格为 skill 的载体形态（第 4 章），怎么造工具归它管</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话定位：上下文工程决定 agent 拿到什么，本 hub 决定它读到的知识可不可信；上下文文件是它每次开工的守则，文档库是它遇事查阅的手册。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 不需要机器学习背景，只假设你在用（或打算用）AI coding agent 参与日常开发：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>会基本的 git 协作——分支、提交、PR 评审；第 4 章的同步策略完全围绕提交与评审展开；</li>\n<li>熟悉 Markdown 基本语法（标题层级、链接、代码块）；</li>\n<li>知道自己项目的构建/测试/lint 命令各自做什么——不需要精通任何具体语言或框架；</li>\n<li>对「上下文窗口」「token 成本」有大概念即可，第 1、3 章用到时会在文中解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>默认完整路径</strong>（任何读者）：按 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 章顺序通读。四章构成「为何重要 → 有哪些类型 → 怎么写 → 怎么保鲜」的闭环，后一章反复引用前一章建立的模型（如失效率 λ、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>read</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>info</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{read}) \\times V_{\\text{info}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">read</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">info</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>项目负责人 / Tech Lead</strong>（要立制度、治理存量）：<a href=\"docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-vs-context-files\">文档与上下文文件的分工</a> → <a href=\"kinds-of-docs-that-help/readme-as-entry-point\">README 作为入口</a> → <a href=\"kinds-of-docs-that-help/adrs-and-decision-records\">ADR 与决策记录</a> → <a href=\"docs-that-stay-true/doc-rot-and-agents\">文档腐烂与 Agent</a> → <a href=\"docs-that-stay-true/keeping-docs-in-sync\">让文档与代码同步</a>。重点在分工判据与流程支点，用于制定团队规范。</p>\n<p><strong>库 / SDK / 平台作者</strong>（产出别人和别的 agent 要消费的接口）：<a href=\"docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-agents-can-use\">Agent 能用的文档</a> → <a href=\"writing-docs-for-both/clear-structured-discoverable\">清晰、有结构、可发现</a> → <a href=\"writing-docs-for-both/examples-and-runnable-docs\">例子与可运行的文档</a> → <a href=\"kinds-of-docs-that-help/inline-docs-and-comments\">内联文档与注释</a>。重点在可用性约束与 doctest 类机制。</p>\n<p><strong>存量文档已腐烂的团队</strong>（救火模式）：直接从第 4 章切入——<a href=\"docs-that-stay-true/doc-rot-and-agents\">文档腐烂与 Agent</a> → <a href=\"docs-that-stay-true/letting-agents-help-with-docs\">让 Agent 帮着写文档</a>，用读写闭环清理存量，再回头补 <a href=\"kinds-of-docs-that-help/adrs-and-decision-records\">ADR 与决策记录</a> 防止复发。</p>\n<p><strong>只有一小时</strong>：<a href=\"docs-in-the-agent-era/who-reads-docs-now\">现在谁在读文档</a> → <a href=\"kinds-of-docs-that-help/readme-as-entry-point\">README 作为入口</a> → <a href=\"writing-docs-for-both/clear-structured-discoverable\">清晰、有结构、可发现</a>，先建立「agent 是挑剔读者样本」的心智，再照入口层清单改自己的仓库。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读：</strong> 跨主题的探索入口（本 hub 内容自包含，以下仅作可选延伸）——想把每次会话自动注入的那层指令文件写好，参见 <a href=\"../project-context-files/\">项目上下文文件</a>；想要覆盖检索、记忆、投放在内的上下文工程全景，参见 <a href=\"../context-engineering-for-codebases/\">代码库上下文工程</a>；想把「动手前先说清楚」做成流程，参见 <a href=\"../spec-driven-development-with-ai/\">规格驱动开发与 AI</a>；要把自己的 API/工具暴露给其他 agent 使用，参见 <a href=\"../agent-ready-apis-and-tools/\">面向 Agent 的 API 与工具设计</a>；想给项目里的 agent 配齐命令、脚本与 MCP 工具，参见 <a href=\"../agent-tooling-in-the-project/\">项目里的 Agent 工具</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docs-in-the-agent-era","title":"Docs In The Agent Era","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"who-reads-docs-now","title":"现在谁在读文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/who-reads-docs-now"},{"seq":2,"slug":"docs-agents-can-use","title":"Agent 能用的文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-agents-can-use"},{"seq":3,"slug":"docs-vs-context-files","title":"文档与上下文文件的分工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-vs-context-files"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"kinds-of-docs-that-help","title":"Kinds Of Docs That Help","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/kinds-of-docs-that-help","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"readme-as-entry-point","title":"README 作为入口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/kinds-of-docs-that-help/readme-as-entry-point"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adrs-and-decision-records","title":"ADR 与决策记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/kinds-of-docs-that-help/adrs-and-decision-records"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inline-docs-and-comments","title":"内联文档与注释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/kinds-of-docs-that-help/inline-docs-and-comments"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"writing-docs-for-both","title":"Writing Docs For Both","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/writing-docs-for-both","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clear-structured-discoverable","title":"清晰、有结构、可发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/writing-docs-for-both/clear-structured-discoverable"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeping-docs-close-to-code","title":"让文档贴近代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/writing-docs-for-both/keeping-docs-close-to-code"},{"seq":3,"slug":"examples-and-runnable-docs","title":"例子与可运行的文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/writing-docs-for-both/examples-and-runnable-docs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"docs-that-stay-true","title":"Docs That Stay True","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-that-stay-true","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"doc-rot-and-agents","title":"文档腐烂与 Agent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-that-stay-true/doc-rot-and-agents"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeping-docs-in-sync","title":"让文档与代码同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-that-stay-true/keeping-docs-in-sync"},{"seq":3,"slug":"letting-agents-help-with-docs","title":"让 Agent 帮着写文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-that-stay-true/letting-agents-help-with-docs"}]}]}